        408.4232177734375,
        82.22920227050781
      ],
      "text": "What is the certainty of the evidence of resource requirements (costs)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.16522979736328,
        526.9479370117188,
        106.31022644042969
      ],
      "text": "Direct costs related to test kits and machinery are available, whereas several important items",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.66522979736328,
        526.9657592773438,
        121.81022644042969
      ],
      "text": "related to resource use (e.g. staff time, and overhead and operational costs associated with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.16522979736328,
        526.965576171875,
        137.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "implementing Genoscholar PZA-TB II) have not been investigated. Differences in resource use",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        527.0458374023438,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "between Genoscholar PZA-TB II and existing approaches will vary across settings that are using",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.980483055114746,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        526.7000732421875,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "different phenotypic and genotypic DST. Also, there is important variability in costs of staff time",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970710754394531,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.66522216796875,
        320.1883850097656,
        183.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "and operation (e.g. testing volume) across settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.85614013671875,
        503.5233154296875,
        207.7371368408203
      ],
      "text": "Does the cost–effectiveness of the intervention favour the intervention or the comparison?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.67303466796875,
        526.965576171875,
        231.8180389404297
      ],
      "text": "No cost–effectiveness studies were identified using the Genoscholar PZA-TB II. Extrapolation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.17303466796875,
        526.96337890625,
        247.3180389404297
      ],
      "text": "of cost–effectiveness data from other LPAs is not advised owing to differences in diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        249.67303466796875,
        456.7725830078125,
        262.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "accuracy, resistance prevalence, and the testing and treatment cascade of care.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.6768798828125,
        527.1258544921875,
        286.8218994140625
      ],
